@page
@model Portfolio.Pages.Skills.WebModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Web";
}

<h2>@ViewData["Title"]</h2>
<h3>@ViewData["Message"]</h3>

<div class="row pt-3">
    <div class="col-md-12">
        <h3>ASP.NET Web Development</h3>
        <p>
            My web development experience includes ASP.NET websites, Razor Pages, MVC applications, Blazor applications, WordPress-based
            business sites, and responsive mobile-friendly interfaces. This portfolio itself is part of that story and reflects the ongoing
            practice of building and refining production-style web content in .NET.
        </p>
        <h3>Modern Web Direction</h3>
        <p>
            More recent public work shows my continued growth into Blazor and newer .NET web application patterns. Blazor-Chat-App uses
            .NET 10, Aspire, Redis output caching, EF Core, and a web-first application structure. Developer-Toolbox also shows attention
            to front-end developer experience through Node.js support, React-friendly tooling, and Dev Container based setup.
        </p>
        <h3>Foundational Web Skills</h3>
        <p>
            My older public repositories still matter because they show the foundations underneath the newer stack. Cit261 and CIT261Team
            highlight direct HTML, CSS, JavaScript, DOM work, and responsive thinking. Earlier consulting and product work adds eCommerce,
            hosted web applications, and practical customer-facing delivery experience.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <h3>Summary</h3>
        <ul class="list-group">
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">HTML / CSS / JavaScript</li>
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">Responsive Web Design</li>
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">Razor Pages</li>
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">ASP.NET MVC</li>
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">Blazor Web Applications</li>
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">Bootstrap and common UI libraries</li>
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">WordPress and hosted business sites</li>
            <li class="list-group-item list-group-item-info fw-bolder">Mobile-friendly layout and presentation</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <h3>External Links</h3>
        <a class="btn btn-info btn-site" href="https://github.com/MCLifeLeader/ePortfolio" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ePortfolio &gt;&gt;</a><br />
        <a class="btn btn-info btn-site" href="https://github.com/MCLifeLeader/Blazor-Chat-App" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Blazor-Chat-App &gt;&gt;</a><br />
        <a class="btn btn-info btn-site" href="https://github.com/MCLifeLeader/Cit261" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cit261 &gt;&gt;</a><br />
        <a class="btn btn-info btn-site" href="https://AGameEmpowerment.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AGameEmpowerment.com &gt;&gt;</a><br />
    </div>
</div>
